# Supabase

- Schema changes are forward-only SQL files in `supabase/migrations`.
- File names match `YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_short_name.sql`.
- Do not edit schema in the dashboard and leave it out of a migration.
- Personal rows store ciphertext. State the row level security policy in `docs/SECURITY_MODEL.md` when a table is added.
- An empty migration directory is valid at this version. There are no product tables yet.
